title: The interview
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_national
view-if: media_timer <= 0 and sanchez_active = 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; media_timer = 2

= The interview

A prime-time interview on La Sexta. What is the message?

- @change: Change: Spain needs a different government
- @reform: Reform and stability: a serious party for difficult times
- @attack_podemos: Podemos is not the answer
- @easy_discard

@change
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {workers: 2, students: 3, unemployed: 2}); } Q.progressives_dissent -= 3; Q.member_morale += 3; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.position(Q, 0.5, 0); } !}

Young and working voters respond. Your most cautious barons wince at the word "change".

@reform
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {professionals: 2, pensioners: 2, self_employed: 1}); } Q.institutionalists_dissent -= 3; Q.modernisers_dissent -= 2; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.position(Q, -0.5, 0); } !}

Older and middle-class voters hear a party of government. Some members hear a party afraid of its own shadow.

@attack_podemos
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {pensioners: 3, homemakers: 2, students: -2}); } Q.rel_up -= 10; Q.regional_leaders_dissent -= 4; Q.progressives_dissent += 4; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.position(Q, -0.5, 0); } !}

The barons enjoy it. Iglesias replies within the hour.

@rally
title: A rally
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_national
view-if: rally_timer <= 0 and sanchez_active = 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rally_timer = 2

= A rally

The hall is booked and the buses are on their way. What is tonight's speech about?

Each big-hall theme costs 1 in party funds; a local event costs nothing.

- @jobs: Decent jobs: end the precarious contracts of the labour reform
- @welfare: The welfare state: health, education, dependency care
- @corruption_speech: Clean politics: end the PP's corruption
- @spain: One Spain, plural and united
- @local: Whatever matters most in this town
- @easy_discard

@jobs
subtitle: Costs 1 in party funds.
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough party funds.
on-arrival: {! Q.funds -= 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {workers: 3, unemployed: 3, students: 1}); } Q.trade_unionists_dissent -= 4; Q.progressives_dissent -= 2; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.position(Q, 0.5, 0); } !}

The unions applaud. Business organisations call it a step backwards.

@welfare
subtitle: Costs 1 in party funds.
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough party funds.
on-arrival: {! Q.funds -= 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {pensioners: 2, homemakers: 2, workers: 1}); } Q.trade_unionists_dissent -= 2; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.position(Q, 0.3, 0); } !}

Classic social democracy, and still the PSOE's strongest ground.

@corruption_speech
view-if: role_in_gov = 0
subtitle: Costs 1 in party funds.
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough party funds.
on-arrival: {! Q.funds -= 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {professionals: 2, students: 1, workers: 1}); window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'pp', {professionals: -1, self_employed: -0.5}); } Q.rel_pp -= 4; !}

The audience chants about Bárcenas. [? if pp_scandal >= 2 : With the PP in the dock, the message lands harder. ?]

@spain
subtitle: Costs 1 in party funds.
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough party funds.
on-arrival: {! Q.funds -= 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {pensioners: 2, homemakers: 1, self_employed: 1}); } Q.regional_leaders_dissent -= 4; Q.rel_erc -= 4; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.position(Q, 0, -0.5); } !}

A big Spanish flag behind the stage. The barons approve; the PSC is less sure.

@local
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {workers: 1.5, pensioners: 1, unemployed: 1, homemakers: 0.5}); } !}

Roads, hospitals, the local factory. Nothing memorable, nothing risky.

@debate
title: The televised debate
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_national
view-if: election_year > 0 and debate_timer <= 0 and sanchez_active = 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; debate_timer = 3

= The televised debate

The cameras are on. Your opponent is across the table. How do you play it?

- @aggressive: Go for the jugular: question the Prime Minister's decency over corruption
- @presidential: Look presidential: calm, numbers, proposals
- @left: Fight Podemos for the left
- @defend_record: Defend the government's record
- @easy_discard

@aggressive
view-if: role_in_gov = 0
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {workers: 2, students: 2, unemployed: 2, pensioners: -1}); } Q.rel_pp -= 12; Q.member_morale += 6; Q.institutionalists_dissent += 3; !}

"You are not a decent man," you tell him. The clip is everywhere by midnight. The members love it; the commentators are split.

@presidential
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {pensioners: 2, professionals: 2, self_employed: 1}); } Q.sanchez_authority += 3; !}

No knockout, no gaffe. The undecided see a possible Prime Minister.

@defend_record
view-if: role_in_gov = 1
on-arrival: {! var f = Math.max(0.4, 1.3 - (Q.govt_months || 0) / 48); if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {pensioners: 1.5 * f, workers: 1.2 * f, professionals: 0.8 * f}); } Q.sanchez_authority += 2; !}

You are the one being attacked, so you answer with numbers: pensions, jobs, the minimum wage. [? if govt_years >= 4 : After this long in office, the record is also a list of things that went wrong. ?]

@left
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {workers: 2, unemployed: 2, students: 1}); window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'up', {workers: -1, unemployed: -1}); } Q.rel_up -= 8; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.position(Q, 1, 0); } !}

You claim the left as the PSOE's ground. Podemos's voters listen; Podemos's leaders take note.

@corruption
title: The corruption files
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_national
view-if: scandal_timer <= 0 and sanchez_leader = 1 and pm_is_pp = 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; scandal_timer = 3

= The corruption files

Another sumario arrives from the National Court: Gürtel, Púnica, Lezo, the PP's off-the-books accounts. How hard do you push?

- @commission: Demand a parliamentary commission of inquiry
- @resign: Demand [+ pp_leader_short +]'s resignation
- @restraint: Leave it to the judges
- @easy_discard

@commission
on-arrival: {! Q.pp_scandal = (Q.pp_scandal || 0) + 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'pp', {professionals: -1, workers: -1}); } Q.rel_pp -= 6; Q.rel_up += 3; Q.rel_cs += 2; !}

Podemos and Ciudadanos back the commission. The hearings will run for months.

@resign
on-arrival: {! Q.pp_scandal = (Q.pp_scandal || 0) + 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {students: 1, workers: 1}); } Q.rel_pp -= 12; Q.member_morale += 4; !}

A good headline. [+ pp_leader_short +] waits for it to pass.

@restraint
on-arrival: rel_pp += 4; institutionalists_dissent -= 3; member_morale -= 3

Institutional and prudent. Many of your voters wanted more.

@pensions_campaign
title: The pensions march
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_national
view-if: pensions_campaign_timer <= 0 and sanchez_active = 1 and year >= 2016
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; pensions_campaign_timer = 4

= The pensions march

Pensioners are marching in Bilbao and Madrid against a 0.25% annual rise. They are the largest group of voters in Spain, and they vote.

- @march: Join the march: index pensions to inflation
- @pact: Propose a cross-party pact in the Toledo Pact commission
- @easy_discard

@march
subtitle: Costs 1 in party funds.
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough party funds.
on-arrival: {! Q.funds -= 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {pensioners: 4}); } Q.trade_unionists_dissent -= 4; Q.pensions_promise = 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.position(Q, 0.5, 0); } !}

You march with the pensioners. Now you have promised them inflation-linked pensions, and they will remember.

@pact
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {pensioners: 1.5}); } Q.rel_cs += 4; Q.rel_pnv += 3; Q.institutionalists_dissent -= 3; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.position(Q, -0.3, 0); } !}

Serious, consensual and slow. The pensioners are not impressed; the parties are.

@feminism
title: 8 March
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_national
view-if: feminism_timer <= 0 and sanchez_active = 1 and year >= 2017
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; feminism_timer = 6

= 8 March

The feminist strike is one of the largest mobilisations in Spanish history. Millions of women stop work or march.

- @join: Join the strike: the PSOE is a feminist party
- @law: Commit to an equal pay and parental leave law
- @easy_discard

@join
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {students: 2, professionals: 2, homemakers: 1, workers: 1}); } Q.rel_up += 3; Q.progressives_dissent -= 3; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.position(Q, 0, 1.2); } !}

The images of the PSOE leadership in the march travel far. Vox calls it "gender ideology".

@law
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {workers: 1.5, homemakers: 1.5, professionals: 1}); } Q.equality_law = 1; Q.modernisers_dissent -= 3; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.position(Q, 0, 0.6); } !}

Less spectacular, more concrete: equal paternity and maternity leave becomes a flagship promise.

@censure
title: Motion of no confidence
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_national
view-if: pp_governs = 1 and sanchez_leader = 1 and censure_timer <= 0 and election_year = 0
on-display: {!
if (typeof window !== 'undefined' && window.SpainGame) {
    window.SpainGame.renderVote(Q, 'sp-censure-count', 'censure');
}
!}

= Motion of no confidence

A motion of no confidence must name an alternative Prime Minister, you, and needs an absolute majority: 176 yes votes. If it passes, you take office the next day, without an election. If it fails, it strengthens the government.

[? if pp_majority = 1 : The PP holds an absolute majority on its own: no motion can pass. Tabling one would be a gesture, not a threat. ?]Hernando's count of a motion tabled today:

{!<div id="sp-censure-count"></div>!}

- @table: Table the motion
- @root: Not now

@table
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1; Q.censure_timer = 6;
if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.holdCensure(Q); }
if (Q.censure_passed) {
    Q.sanchez_authority += 20; Q.member_morale += 15; Q.sanchismo += 15; Q.federal_committee_balance += 10;
} else {
    Q.sanchez_authority -= 10; Q.member_morale -= 5; Q.rel_pp -= 10;
}
!}
go-to: censure_won if censure_passed = 1; censure_lost if censure_passed = 0

@censure_won
title: Prime Minister

= Prime Minister

{!<img class="sp-event-img" src="img/spain/Spain/Events/Mariano_Rajoy_felicita_al_nuevo_presidente_del_Gobierno_Pedro_S%C3%A1nchez_%282018-06-01%29-%20No%20Confidence.jpg" alt="">!}


{!<div class="sp-last-vote"></div>!}

Yes [+ inv_yes +], no [+ inv_no +], abstentions [+ inv_abstain +]. For the first time in Spanish democracy, a motion of no confidence succeeds. Pedro Sánchez is President of the Government.

@censure_lost
title: The motion fails

= The motion fails

{!<div class="sp-last-vote"></div>!}

Yes [+ inv_yes +], no [+ inv_no +], abstentions [+ inv_abstain +]. The government survives, and its ministers thank you for the show of strength.

