= Media appearance

Your press office has offers from every kind of outlet. Each reaches a different audience, and each costs 1 in party funds (travel, staff, production). Where do you go?

- @tv: A prime-time TV interview (everyone, a little)
- @radio: Morning radio (pensioners and the middle class)
- @streamers: YouTube and streamers (young people)
- @morning_tv: Morning TV and women's magazines (women)
- @regional_press: The regional press (rural Spain)
- @easy_discard

@tv
subtitle: Costs 1 in party funds.
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough party funds.
on-arrival: {! Q.funds -= 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {workers: 1, pensioners: 1, professionals: 0.8, students: 0.8, unemployed: 0.8, homemakers: 0.8, self_employed: 0.5}); window.SpainGame.recalculate(Q); } !}

Millions watch. Nobody remembers much the next day, but it helps.

@radio
subtitle: Costs 1 in party funds.
