@pes_contacts
title: International contacts
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_national
view-if: psoe_in_government = 0 and sanchez_leader = 1 and pes_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; pes_timer = 3

= International contacts

As leader of the opposition you have no ministry, but you do have the Party of European Socialists and the Socialist International. Being seen abroad as a Prime Minister in waiting has its uses.

- @pes_congress: Speak at the PES congress
- @pes_lisbon: Visit António Costa in Lisbon
- @pes_washington: Meet Democrats in Washington
- @root: Not this month

@pes_congress
subtitle: Costs 0.2 in party funds.
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'eu', 3); } Q.sanchez_authority += 1; Q.funds -= 0.2; !}

Social democrats from twenty-seven countries applaud the man who might govern Spain.

@pes_lisbon
subtitle: Costs 0.2 in party funds.
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'south', 4); } Q.rel_up += 1; Q.funds -= 0.2; !}

Costa explains, over lunch, how to govern with the radical left without being swallowed by it.

@pes_washington
subtitle: Costs 0.3 in party funds.
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'us', 4); window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'nato', 2); } Q.funds -= 0.3; !}

The photos with senators look prime-ministerial. The bill is not cheap.

@quiet_week
title: A quiet week
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_national
priority: -1
view-if: weekly = 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1

= A quiet week

The other parties are talking to each other, and every interview, rally and campaign you could run has already been run this month. You stay in Ferraz, read the polls and wait for the phone to ring.

# Lowest priority: it is only drawn when no other National politics card is available, so a week of government formation can always be played.

@campaign_message
title: The campaign message
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_national
view-if: sanchez_active = 1 and message_timer <= 0 and (election_year > 0 or general_election_due = 1 or year * 12 + month >= (legislature_start_year + 4) * 12 + legislature_start_month - 6)
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; message_timer = 3

= The campaign message

Every campaign needs one sentence. What you can credibly say depends on where the PSOE stands: you are **[+ role_word +]**.[? if role_in_gov = 1 : The government has been in office [+ govt_years +] years. ?]

- @msg_change
- @msg_waiting
- @msg_stop_right
- @msg_delivered_supply
- @msg_stability_supply
- @msg_our_turn
- @msg_our_ministers
- @msg_brake
- @msg_lead_next
- @msg_continuity
- @msg_dont_undo
- @msg_stronger_psoe
- @msg_majority_finish
- @msg_blockade
- @msg_record
- @msg_dont_risk
- @easy_discard

@msg_change
title: Time for a change of government
subtitle: The opposition's message: stronger the longer the government has lasted.
view-if: role_opposition = 1
on-arrival: {! var w = Math.min(2, 0.5 + (Q.govt_months || 0) / 24); if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {workers: 1.2 * w, professionals: 1 * w, students: 1 * w, self_employed: 0.5 * w}); } if (window.SpainGame && Q.pm_party) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, Q.pm_party, { professionals: -0.5 * w, workers: -0.4 * w }); } !}

"[+ pm +] has had his chance." The longer the government has lasted, the better it works.

@msg_waiting
title: A government in waiting
subtitle: Credibility: professionals and pensioners; less exciting.
view-if: role_opposition = 1
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {professionals: 1.2, pensioners: 1, self_employed: 0.5}); } Q.sanchez_authority += 2; !}

A shadow programme, costed, and a team that looks ready to govern.

@msg_stop_right
title: Stop the right and the far right
subtitle: Mobilises the left; Podemos loses some useful votes to you.
view-if: role_opposition = 1 and vox_breakthrough = 1
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.transfer(Q, 'up', 'psoe', { students: 0.8, workers: 0.8 }); } if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {homemakers: 0.5, pensioners: 0.4}); }  !}

A vote for the PSOE is the only vote that stops [+ right_leader +] governing with Vox.

@msg_delivered_supply
title: We made them deliver
subtitle: Claim credit for the government's best measures without owning its failures.
view-if: role_supply = 1
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {workers: 0.8, pensioners: 0.8, unemployed: 0.6}); } if (window.SpainGame && Q.pm_party) { window.SpainGame.transfer(Q, Q.pm_party, 'psoe', { workers: 0.4, pensioners: 0.4 }); } Q['rel_' + Q.pm_party] = (Q['rel_' + Q.pm_party] || 40) - 5; !}

Every rise in the minimum wage, every pension increase: the PSOE's votes made it happen.

@msg_stability_supply
title: The party of stability
subtitle: Moderates reward you for keeping Spain governable; your own left grumbles.
view-if: role_supply = 1
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {pensioners: 1, self_employed: 0.6, professionals: 0.6}); } Q.progressives_dissent += 3; !}

Without the PSOE there would have been no government at all.

@msg_our_turn
title: Now it is our turn to lead
subtitle: Break with the government you sustain: a clear choice, and a burned bridge.
view-if: role_supply = 1
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {workers: 1, students: 1, professionals: 0.6}); } Q['rel_' + Q.pm_party] = (Q['rel_' + Q.pm_party] || 40) - 15; Q.member_morale += 4; !}

You announce that the PSOE will no longer prop up anyone else's government.

@msg_our_ministers
title: Our ministers delivered
subtitle: Claim the ministries you hold; worth more the more of them you have.
view-if: role_junior = 1
on-arrival: {! var m = Math.min(1.5, 0.3 + 0.15 * (Q.my_ministries || 0)); if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {workers: m, pensioners: 0.8 * m, homemakers: 0.6 * m}); }  !}

The PSOE's ministers list what they did with their departments.

@msg_brake
title: The brake on [+ pm +]
subtitle: Distance yourself from the senior partner: wins its unhappy voters, strains the coalition.
view-if: role_junior = 1
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame && Q.pm_party) { window.SpainGame.transfer(Q, Q.pm_party, 'psoe', { professionals: 0.8, workers: 0.6, students: 0.5 }); } Q['rel_' + Q.pm_party] = (Q['rel_' + Q.pm_party] || 40) - 10; Q.coalition_strain = (Q.coalition_strain || 0) + 2; !}

Without the PSOE in the government, it would have been much worse.

@msg_lead_next
title: Lead the next government
subtitle: Ask to be the senior partner: bold, divisive inside the coalition.
view-if: role_junior = 1
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {workers: 0.9, students: 0.8, professionals: 0.5}); } Q['rel_' + Q.pm_party] = (Q['rel_' + Q.pm_party] || 40) - 12; Q.member_morale += 5; !}

The PSOE asks to lead, not to follow.

@msg_continuity
title: Four more years of progress
subtitle: Continuity: strong while the government is fresh, weaker as it ages.
view-if: role_coalition = 1 or role_minority = 1
on-arrival: {! var f = Math.max(0.4, 1.3 - (Q.govt_months || 0) / 48); if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {pensioners: 1.2 * f, workers: 1 * f, homemakers: 0.8 * f}); }  !}

Pensions up, unemployment down, rights expanded: finish the job.

@msg_dont_undo
title: Don't let the right undo it
subtitle: Fear of a PP–Vox government: mobilises the left, squeezes the partner.
view-if: role_in_gov = 1 and vox_breakthrough = 1
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.transfer(Q, 'up', 'psoe', { students: 0.7, workers: 0.7, homemakers: 0.4 }); } if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {pensioners: 0.5}); }  !}

Everything this government did, a PP–Vox government would repeal in its first month.

@msg_stronger_psoe
title: A stronger PSOE, a less dependent government
subtitle: Squeeze your coalition partner for its voters; the partner resents it.
view-if: role_coalition = 1
on-arrival: {! var pt = (Q.govt_parties || []).filter(function (p) { return p !== Q.player_party; })[0]; if (window.SpainGame && pt) { window.SpainGame.transfer(Q, pt, 'psoe', { workers: 1, students: 0.8, professionals: 0.6 }); } if (pt) { Q['rel_' + pt] = (Q['rel_' + pt] || 40) - 10; } Q.coalition_strain = (Q.coalition_strain || 0) + 2; !}

The stronger the PSOE, the less the government depends on anyone else.

@msg_majority_finish
title: Give us the majority to finish the job
subtitle: A minority government asks for a mandate: moderates like it, partners do not.
view-if: role_minority = 1
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {pensioners: 1, professionals: 0.8, self_employed: 0.5}); } ['up', 'erc', 'pnv'].forEach(function (p) { Q['rel_' + p] = (Q['rel_' + p] || 40) - 4; }); !}

Every law this term was a negotiation. A stronger PSOE would not need to beg.

@msg_blockade
title: They blocked everything
subtitle: Blame the opposition for the budgets and laws that failed.
view-if: role_minority = 1 or role_coalition = 1
on-arrival: {! var b = Math.min(1.6, 0.4 + 0.4 * ((Q.budget_passed === 0 ? 1 : 0) + (Q.laws_failed || 0))); if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {workers: b, pensioners: b, students: 0.6 * b}); } Q.rel_pp -= 5; !}

The right voted against pensions, against the minimum wage, against the budget.

@msg_record
title: Our record
subtitle: A majority government runs on what it did: as good as the economy.
view-if: role_majority = 1
on-arrival: {! var e = Math.max(-0.5, Math.min(1.5, (Q.growth || 0) / 2 - ((Q.unemployment || 15) - 12) / 6)); if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {professionals: e, pensioners: e, workers: e, self_employed: 0.6 * e}); }  !}

The economy, the jobs, the pensions: the record speaks for itself[? if growth < 1 : , though not as loudly as you would like ?].

@msg_dont_risk
title: Don't risk it
subtitle: Stability against adventure; works with older voters, bores the young.
view-if: role_majority = 1 or role_minority = 1
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {pensioners: 1.2, homemakers: 0.6, students: -0.4}); }  !}

Stability, or a jump into the unknown.
